    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sealubbers</i> is a top-down 2D pirate RPG about building a crew, battling ships, and getting rich however you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll sail around a weird, lively world picking up crew members with all kinds of personalities and skills. Some are helpful, some chaotic. When you run into trouble (which happens a lot), you\u2019ll fight ship-to-ship, then board the enemy and throw down in full crew sword fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. You\u2019ll stumble across strange quests, make dumb choices, and occasionally strike gold. The world\u2019s alive, your crew is a mess, and nothing ever goes quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Sealubbers</i> if that sounds like your kind of adventure.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sealubbers</i> is a top-down 2D pirate RPG about building a crew, battling ships, and getting rich however you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll sail around a weird, lively world picking up crew members with all kinds of personalities and skills. Some are helpful, some chaotic. When you run into trouble (which happens a lot), you\u2019ll fight ship-to-ship, then board the enemy and throw down in full crew sword fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. You\u2019ll stumble across strange quests, make dumb choices, and occasionally strike gold. The world\u2019s alive, your crew is a mess, and nothing ever goes quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Sealubbers</i> if that sounds like your kind of adventure.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Set sail in Sealubbers, a pirate RPG. Command your pirate ship, recruit a crew, battle and board enemy vessels, and hunt for buried treasure. Embark on quests, meet intriguing characters, and forge your legend as the most famous pirate on the high seas.",
